boss_description = "The ancient hive sovereign alternates continuing brood releases with fixed royal spore blooms. Below 70% hull, marked charge lanes join the sequence; below 35%, a faster cadence brings the familiar attacks closer together. Escape each warned pulse and punish her recovery. Her surviving brood persists after she dies."
